@startuml Feature_UserBenefit

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "User Benefits" {
  [Simple Integration] as benefit1
  [No Complex Wiring] as benefit2
  [Flexible Configuration] as benefit3
  [Time & Cost Savings] as benefit4
  [Multi-Channel Support] as benefit5
}

note right of benefit1
  Serial interface provides
  easy-to-use commands for
  analog signal reading
end note

note right of benefit2
  No need for external ADC
  circuits or analog conditioning
end note

note right of benefit3
  Configurable resolution,
  sampling rate to match
  sensor requirements
  Raw ADC data for direct processing
end note

note right of benefit4
  Reduces development time
  and eliminates need for
  specialized analog hardware
end note

note right of benefit5
  Read multiple analog sensors
  simultaneously through single
  serial interface
end note

benefit1 -down-> benefit4
benefit2 -down-> benefit4
benefit3 -down-> benefit5

@enduml
